# Five independent moved cocode vectors for quadratic Mathieu pairs

Each nontrivial compatible pair selects five displacement columns and a left
inverse. The companion checks verify the certificates against the already
verified native cocode matrices; no untrusted computation enters the proofs.
Source: Aschbacher--Smith K.4.1, printed p.458.
